      "Context": "[Browsingway] Settings.CommandSettingBoolean",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ IChatGui.PrintError",
      "Translated": "。可用值：on、off、toggle。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Browsingway Settings",
      "Context": "[Browsingway] Settings.Render",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Begin",
      "Translated": "Browsingway 设置",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "General",
      "Context": "[Browsingway] Settings.RenderPaneSelector",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Selectable",
      "Translated": "常规",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "- Overlays -",
      "Context": "[Browsingway] Settings.RenderPaneSelector",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Text",
      "Translated": "－ 悬浮窗 －",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Select an overlay on the left to edit its settings.",
      "Context": "[Browsingway] Settings.RenderGeneralSettings",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Text",
      "Translated": "从左侧选择悬浮窗以编辑设置。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Command Help",
      "Context": "[Browsingway] Settings.RenderGeneralSettings",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.CollapsingHeader",
      "Translated": "命令帮助",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Open this configuration window.",
      "Context": "[Browsingway] Settings.RenderGeneralSettings",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Text",
      "Translated": "打开此设置窗口。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Change a setting for an overlay.\n\toverlayCommandName: The overlay to edit. Use the 'Command Name' shown in its config.\n\tsetting: Value to change. Accepted settings are:\n\t\turl: string\n\t\tdisabled: boolean\n\t\tmuted: boolean\n\t\tact: boolean\n\t\tlocked: boolean\n\t\thidden: boolean\n\t\ttypethrough: boolean\n\t\tclickthrough: boolean\n\t\tfullscreen: boolean\n\t\treload: -\n\tvalue: Value to set for the setting. Accepted values are:\n\t\tstring: any string value\n\t\tboolean: on, off, toggle",
      "Context": "[Browsingway] Settings.RenderGeneralSettings",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextWrapped",
      "Translated": "修改悬浮窗的一个设置。\n\toverlayCommandName：要编辑的悬浮窗，请填写其设置中的「命令名」。\n\tsetting：要修改的设置，可选项如下：\n\t\turl：文本\n\t\tdisabled：开关\n\t\tmuted：开关\n\t\tact：开关\n\t\tlocked：开关\n\t\thidden：开关\n\t\ttypethrough：开关\n\t\tclickthrough：开关\n\t\tfullscreen：开关\n\t\treload：无需参数\n\tvalue：要设置的值，可填写：\n\t\t文本：任意字符串\n\t\t开关：on、off、toggle",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Name",
      "Context": "[Browsingway] Settings.RenderOverlaySettings",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.InputText",
      "Translated": "名称",
      "Source": "library"
    },
